Subject: [PATCH 0010] sh4: melco trace events for the cup2006/cup28 boards

# melco-nav-emu core patch.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
# Copyright (c) 2026 melco-nav-emu contributors
# Modifies GPL-licensed QEMU sources; applied by scripts/qemu.sh.

Append the board models' trace events (the trace_cup2006_*/trace_cup28_*
calls in machine/cup2006*.c and machine/cup28*.c) to hw/sh4/trace-events, so
`-trace 'cup2006_*'` / `-trace 'cup28_*'` log device activity on stderr.

